Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:18.05,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}不妨坦然接受 尝试微笑以对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:22.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}烛华不吝照耀 光芒终将殆尽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:33.31,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}我们依旧奋勇直前 直到燃尽生命之火
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:36.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}发得出声音的玩具也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:39.15,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}能吹飞疼痛的魔法也好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:43.57,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}于我而言都是无价之宝
